# anvil/config/versions.env
#
# SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for Anvil v3 runtime version floors.
# `anvilctl doctor` parses this file (KEY=VALUE) and compares against installed
# binary versions; `anvilctl start` refuses to boot an out-of-policy binary.
#
# Bump a floor ONLY when:
#   (a) a CVE advisory touches the running version, OR
#   (b) a feature Anvil depends on lands in the new release.
# Every bump belongs to a commit that names the advisory/feature in its message.
#
# Format: KEY=VERSION  (semver, no leading 'v'; the doctor normalizes both)
# Lines starting with '#' are comments; blank lines ignored.

# Caddy — edge tier. Stock binary, no custom modules (CVE-auditable).
# Floor 2.11.1: CVE-2026-27589 (admin-API CSRF) fixed.
# Current as of 2026-08-28: 2.11.4.
CADDY=2.11.4

# FrankenPHP — app tier. Worker mode required (ADR-017).
# Floor 1.12.5: security release (1.11.2 perf, 1.12.5 security).
# Current as of 2026-08-28: 1.12.7 (PHP 8.5).
# IMPORTANT: anvilctl doctor ALSO verifies the embedded Caddy lineage is >=2.11.1
# (CVE-2026-27589 posture), independent of the standalone Caddy floor above.
FRANKENPHP=1.12.7

# Tengine — internal LB tier. Loopback-only (RULE T1).
# Floor 3.2.0: includes the fix for CVE-2026-42945 ("NGINX Rift", heap overflow
# in ngx_http_rewrite_module, RCE-class) which 3.1.0 carried for ~3 months
# after upstream nginx shipped the fix. Until 3.2.0 final ships, Anvil v3
# supports building from the 3.2.0-rc3 source tarball (lb/tengine.build.sh)
# OR running in Option B (Caddy-only, §3.5 of the v3 doc).
TENGINE=3.2.0

# Embedded Caddy lineage inside FrankenPHP — separate floor because FrankenPHP
# vendors a Caddy build that may lag the standalone binary.
FRANKENPHP_EMBEDDED_CADDY=2.11.1
